# .engineignore — paths exempt from task-card union gating (gitignore-style globs)
#
# v6.13.0 (T-052/D-036, issue #17): Paths matching this file bypass the
# "no active card" block and the union_allows WRITE-SET check in pre-commit,
# but STILL face FORBIDDEN, protected-path, and dist-stale gates.
#
# DO NOT list product paths here (src/**, runtime/**, contract/**) —
# doctor will WARN on misuse. This file is for non-product paths only.
#
# Uncomment lines as needed for your project:

# Cross-agent anchors synced by engine-sync-agent-anchors.*
# .github/copilot-instructions.md
# .cursor/rules/engine.md
# GEMINI.md
# .clinerules
# .roorules

# Engine tooling auto-updated by `engine update` (non-product)
# engine/scripts/**
# engine/prompts/**
# engine/bin/**

# Project-level config
# .claude/settings.json
# .gitignore
# CHANGELOG.md
